Sources/Combine is a port of OpenCombine (https://github.com/OpenCombine/OpenCombine),
release 0.14.0, Copyright (c) 2019 Sergej Jaskiewicz, used under the MIT license (see LICENSE
in this directory). The module is renamed to Combine, the OpenCombineFoundation and
OpenCombineDispatch targets are merged in with their OCombine namespaces flattened to
Apple's names, and the C++ helper target is replaced by Swift (see docs/decisions/ADR-0008-combine.md).
